#: setupwizard.cpp:292
msgid ""
"How long should LISa wait for answers to pings ?"
"<br>If LISa doesn't find all hosts, try to increase this value.<br>"
msgstr ""

#: kcmlisa.cpp:119 kcmreslisa.cpp:88 setupwizard.cpp:296
